Inspect Lua chunks through lua_dump instead of Lua's private structures,
so the game builds with the system Lua, which does not ship ldebug.h,
lobject.h, lopcodes.h or lstate.h. The lua_runtime.cpp part of Orion2
Redone's commit 14d99ae ("Support optional system libraries and
strengthen Lua profile validation"), after Battle at Antares was forked;
the file is unchanged in Battle at Antares since.

https://github.com/orion2re/orion2re/commit/14d99aea33a1cff06fca76e810b156fe6409bc20

